@attribute [Route(GlobalValues.Path_Services_Live_Region)]

<PageTitle>@GlobalValues.Page_Title_Services_Live_Region</PageTitle>

<h1 class="page-heading">@GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Services_Live_Region</h1>

<p>
    The Live Region Service allows you to send announcements to ARIA live regions, which are monitored by assistive technologies. These technologies
    then relay this information to their users; for example, screen readers will output the text as speech.
</p>

<p>
    <b>Important: </b>In order to use the Live Region Service, you need to ensure that is has been registered in the <span class="code-span">Program.cs</span> file (Both server and client
    if using Server and WebAssembly interactive rendermode) and that the <span class="code-span">&lt;AnnouncementHistory /&gt;</span> component has been added as it contains the live regions used.
    Please see the <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Class" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Overview_Getting_Started">@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_About - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Overview_Getting_Started</a> page for details.
</p>


<section class="code-table two-col-descriptive">

    <h2 id="iliveregionservice-interface" class="code-table__heading">ILiveRegionService interface</h2>

    <table aria-labelledby="iliveregionservice-interface">

        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Method</th>
                <th scope="col">Description</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>MakeAnnouncement(Announcement announcement)</td>
                <td>Dispatches an announcement to be spoken by a screen reader. Returns a <span class="code-span">Task</span>.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

</section>

<section class="code-table">

    <h2 id="announcement-record" class="code-table__heading">Announcement record</h2>

    <table aria-labelledby="announcement-record">

        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Property</th>
                <th scope="col">Type</th>
                <th scope="col">Description</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Message</td>
                <td>string</td>
                <td>The text content to be spoken by the screen reader.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>AnnouncementType</td>
                <td>AnnouncementType (enum)</td>
                <td>TThe semantic classification (e.g., Info, Success, Error).</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>AnnouncementTrigger</td>
                <td>string?</td>
                <td>Optional text describing what triggered this announcement. For example clicking a Save Button you would just pass "Save Button"</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>LiveRegionType</td>
                <td>LiveRegionType (enum)</td>
                <td>The ARIA priority level (Polite or Assertive).</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

</section>

<section>


    <h2 class="page-heading">Supporting enums</h2>

    <section class="code-table">

        <h3 id="announcementtype-enum" class="code-table__heading">AnnouncementType enum</h3>

        <table aria-labelledby="announcementtype-enum">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Value</th>
                    <th scope="col">Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>0</td>
                    <td>Info</td>
                    <td>General informational announcement..</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td>OperationStarted</td>
                    <td>Indicates an operation has started.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>2</td>
                    <td>OperationCompleted</td>
                    <td>Indicates an operation has completed successfully.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>3</td>
                    <td>OperationFailed</td>
                    <td>Indicates an operation has failed.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>4</td>
                    <td>OperationCancelled</td>
                    <td>Indicates an operation was cancelled.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>5</td>
                    <td>SystemWarning</td>
                    <td>System-level warning message.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>6</td>
                    <td>SystemError</td>
                    <td>System-level error message.</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

    </section>
    <section class="code-table">

        <h3 id="liveregiontype-enum" class="code-table__heading">LiveRegionType enum</h3>

        <table aria-labelledby="liveregiontype-enum">

            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">Value</th>
                    <th scope="col">Name</th>
                    <th scope="col">Description</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr>
                    <td>0</td>
                    <td>Polite</td>
                    <td>Waits for the screen reader to finish current speech before announcing.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>1</td>
                    <td>Assertive</td>
                    <td>Interrupts the screen reader immediately.</td>
                </tr>

            </tbody>
        </table>

    </section>
</section>

<section>
    <h2 class="page-heading">Making announcements</h2>

    <p>
        Please keep your messages short and to the point, for example on completion of saving a customer entry "Saved Successfully" would be sufficient.
        Provide context when necessary; the "Theme" button on this site uses the live regions service as follows:
    </p>
    <CodeBox CodeBlock="@CodeSnippets.Make_Announcement" AriaLabel="Making an announcement code block" />
</section>


<div class="flex-content justify-content-between">
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Left_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Theming_CSS_Colour_Variables">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_Theming - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Theming_CSS_Colour_Variables</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
    <a class="@GlobalValues.Link_Button_Class @GlobalValues.Link_Button_Right_Arrow_Modifier" href="@GlobalValues.Path_Frameworks_Modal_Dialog">
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span>@GlobalValues.Main_Nav_Section_Heading_Frameworks - @GlobalValues.Page_Heading_Frameworks_Modal_Dialog</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
</div>



